{"type":"text","timestamp":1771278594454,"sessionID":"ses_39792b2acffes24lLpslUnVB8E","part":{"id":"prt_c686e6a6b001OvJS5Lwb1W83Va","sessionID":"ses_39792b2acffes24lLpslUnVB8E","messageID":"msg_c686e5802001JS2LlQRPZgvlPI","type":"text","text":"I have created a server component that reads the \"theme\" cookie and \"Accept-Language\" header as requested.\n\nHere is the file structure I created:\n- `app/components/ThemeDisplay.tsx`: The server component.\n\nI also updated `app/page.tsx` to include this component so you can see it in action.\n\n### 1. Created `app/components/ThemeDisplay.tsx`\n\nThis component uses `cookies()` and `headers()` from `next/headers` to access the request data.\n\n```tsx\nimport { cookies, headers } from 'next/headers';\n\nexport default async function ThemeDisplay() {\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n  const theme = cookieStore.get('theme')?.value || 'light';\n\n  const headersList = await headers();\n  const acceptLanguage = headersList.get('accept-language');\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <p>Current Theme: {theme}</p>\n      {acceptLanguage && <p>Preferred Language: {acceptLanguage}</p>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Updated `app/page.tsx`\n\nI imported and used the `ThemeDisplay` component in your main page.\n\n```tsx\nimport ThemeDisplay from './components/ThemeDisplay';\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return (\n    <main>\n      <h1>User Preferences</h1>\n      <ThemeDisplay />\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n```","time":{"start":1771278594453,"end":1771278594453},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
